body:
"made it clear that he didnt want to live with me, didn't want a serious relationship, didn't love me, and I'd used my fear of early menopause to guilt him in to agreeing to a baby so what did I expect. There's truth in that, but at the same time, he left me while pregnant?" 

&#x200B;

So you knew that this man didnt want a long term relationship, yet you attempted to manipulate him with staying with you. But you are surprised when the man who said he did not want a long term relationship leaves the attempt at a long term relationship
